// Renaming applies throughout the module: effects, conditions, derivations, duty clauses, and `Against` lists all refer to the instantiated names.
Fact actor Identified by Alice, Bob
Module guard(thing) {
  Fact locked Identified by thing
  Act open Actor actor Recipient actor' Related to thing Conditioned by Not(locked(thing)) Holds when True
  Immunity shielded Holder actor Against open
  Duty keep Holder actor Claimant actor' Related to thing Violated when locked(thing)
}
Fact door Identified by D
Use guard(door) As d.
?lawful d-open(Alice, Bob, D).
+d-locked(D).
?!lawful d-open(Alice, Bob, D).
+d-shielded(Bob).
?!valid d-open(Alice, Bob, D).
+d-keep(Alice, Bob, D).
?violated d-keep(Alice, Bob, D).
